# Strict allowlist build context for the LB image (S3.T10, spec D21).
#
# The leading `*` excludes everything by default, so adding a new top-level
# directory never accidentally slips secrets, docs, or gigabytes into the
# build context. Only what `go build ./cmd/l7LoadBalancer` and the config COPY
# actually need is re-included.
*
!go.mod
!go.sum
!cmd/
!internal/
!configs/
